Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: document the candidate X1 camera resources

Extend CAMSS and add PHY/sensor schemas scoped to the reconciled camera driver and reference board
resources. Existing upstream CCI binding already covers the X1E compatible.
Schema maintainer entries name the existing upstream subsystem/driver owners;
no new patch author identity or DCO sign-off is asserted.
See ../camera-bindings-review.md for architectural and validation limits.

